        "_uid": "ae83632e-4814-4643-9b0f-24ddd68bf693",
        "date": "Nov 28, 2025",
        "quote": "       In the practice of medicine, knowledge and ethics must walk hand in hand. The patient before us is not a case to be managed, but a life to be honoured.",
        "variant": "centered",
        "category": "Convocation",
        "portrait": {
